        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/03/maps.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ads are <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/03/24/ads-are-coming-to-apple-maps-in-the-us-and-canada-this-summer-with-a-privacy-centric-focus/\">coming</a> to Apple Maps in the United States and Canada sometime this summer. Ahead of that launch, Apple has shared more details about what will and won’t be allowed for ads in Apple Maps.</p>",
