        "title": "Eve-ry Day!",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213876/Eve-ry-Day",
        "content_text": "For almost every day in a three day span, Drue Langlois dropped new eleven-minute episodes of his specific-vibe-based animated series <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLb7rj_MqyB8qa1kb5DDii24aalBYuIQcX\">Dudes of Hazmat</a> (<a href=\"https://www.metafilter.com/199604/Every-Day-Is-Like-My-Birthday-Every-Way-Ive-Got-To-Treasure-The-Moment\">previously</a>): a trendy new health supplement causes a spot of trouble in <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7T8vko0CkOU\">Keeva</a>, and it turns out that all's fair in love and Hell in <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ISH7RP3MvZw\">Beast Laid Plans</a>.",
