        "title": "Apple sends legal letters to former employees now at OpenAI",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/17/apple-sends-legal-letters-to-former-employees-now-at-openai/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/apple-openai.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Last week, Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/10/apple-sues-openai-trade-secret-theft/\">filed a lawsuit against OpenAI</a> in which it alleged that its former employees have stolen trade secrets “for the benefit of OpenAI.”</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As part of this process, Apple has reportedly sent letters directly to dozens of its former employees now working at OpenAI.</p>",
