        "title": "Judge dismisses lawsuit accusing Apple of failing to stop CSAM on iCloud",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/14/judge-dismisses-lawsuit-accusing-apple-of-failing-to-stop-csam-on-icloud/",
