        "content_text": "The Jolie Blondes, a country, country-rock, bluegrass and rockabilly quartet, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9uw2QNENVb8\">covering The Weight by The Band</a>, at Swart Bier &amp; Weinlokal in Berlin. But what's a favourite cover, or remake (in any media) that you have heard or seen? Or have you covered a piece of music e.g. at karaoke, or art, or culture yourself in some way? Or talk about what's going on with you as this is <strong>your free thread</strong>.",
