        "title": "Deals: AirPods with ANC from $119, AirPods Pro 3, MacBook Pro up to $400 off, Thunderbolt 5 Dock, more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/16/deals-airpods-with-anc-airpods-pro-3-macbook-pro/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/Apple-deals-AirPods-4-Pro-MacBook-Thunderbolt-5.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today’s <em>9to5Toys Lunch Break</em> is headlined by the ongoing $50 price drop on AirPods Pro 3, but we also have AirPods 4 with ANC hitting best price in months at Amazon today, as well as a chance to land a set Apple Watch Series 11 lineup and a rare Amazon low on Hyper’s latest 120Gbps <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/07/16/hyper-thunderbolt-5-dock-ssd-mac-deal/\">Thunderbolt 5 Dock with SSD enclosure $80 off</a>. Head below for a closer look. </p>",
        "type": "Technology",
